<P class="tit">关于做好2024～2025学年第二学期期末考试工作的通知</P>
<P class="zd"><SPAN>2025-05-22&nbsp;&nbsp;</SPAN><SPAN>审核人：<!--</SPAN><span style="color:red;">审核人参数配置未打开</span><SPAN>-->&nbsp;&nbsp;(已浏览<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1070628979, 18813)</script>)</SPAN></P>
